We are seeking to expand our Go-To-Market team in RCTT (short for Retail, Consumer, Travel and Transportation) in Europe with a special focus on the Retail sector in the UK&amp;I.&nbsp;

Specifically, we are looking for a leader who is experienced with selling and delivering digital transformations encompassing our core offerings of Customer Experience, Product Innovation, Enterprise Platform Modernization, Data Modernization, AI Readiness, Engineering Excellence and Digital Application and Maintenance Operations (DAMO).&nbsp;

You will be inheriting one large portfolio in the Retail space based on which you will grow the existing account, and acquire new accounts based on your network, your industry expertise and our marketing activities and in close collaboration with your account team, our industry and service line specialists and the RCTT market organization.&nbsp;

As a Client Principals, you are responsible for the entire sales cycle (lead generation through proposal, contract negotiation and closure) as well as client relationship management, account strategy and planning, joint delivery governance and project reviews.&nbsp;

This includes e.g.&nbsp;

● Understand the industry context, the customer problem and define mutual value ● Develop and execute on key account plans and overall go-to-market&nbsp;

● Acquire and nurture senior client relationships on strategic accounts&nbsp;

● Achieve established revenue and profitability targets&nbsp;

● Work closely with the account leadership team (consisting e.g. of the account tech director and account delivery director)&nbsp;

